'''Pocket Monsters BW: The Heroes of Fire and Thunder''' (Japanese: '''ポケットモンスターB・W　炎雷の英雄''') is a [[Pokémon manga]] that was serialized in [[CoroCoro|CoroCoro Special]] between February and October 2011. It is illustrated and written by [[Satoshi Kanda]]. 

